# Generated store screenshots: ~260 MB of retina PNGs, and every one of them is
# reproducible from store/screenshots/capture-android.sh / capture-ios.sh. The
# capture scripts and scenes.js next to them ARE tracked — only the output is
# ignored, so these paths are anchored rather than a bare `android/`/`ios/`
# (which would also swallow the app wrappers at the repo root).
store/screenshots/android/
store/screenshots/ios/
